## 2. Updated Platform & Architecture Strategy

### ✅ All Feedback Incorporated

| User Feedback | Decision |
|---|---|
| "I want single app for both Android + iOS" | ✅ **React Native (Expo)** — single codebase for Android + iOS |
| "I want to create a Website as well" | ✅ **Next.js** website sharing same API backend |
| "For now can we go with SQLite local database" | ✅ **SQLite on device** (local cache/offline) + **PostgreSQL on server** (required for multi-platform real-time sync) |
| "Self-hosted infrastructure with upgrade option" | ✅ **Self-hosted VPS** (DigitalOcean/Hetzner) with migration path to AWS/Firebase |
| "Admin should have complete control" | ✅ **Dynamic admin configuration system** — every setting is admin-controlled |
| "All 3 platforms work in real-time with same database" | ✅ **Single PostgreSQL backend** serving all platforms via shared REST + WebSocket APIs |

