### 🆕 Feature 1: Emergency SOS System

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as 👤 User in Danger
    participant App as 📱 App
    participant Sys as ⚙️ System
    participant N as 👥 Nearby Neighbors
    participant E as 🚨 Emergency Contacts
    
    U->>App: Long-press SOS button (3 sec)
    App->>Sys: SOS Alert + GPS coordinates
    Sys->>N: Push notification to all users within 1km
    Sys->>E: SMS + Call to user's emergency contacts
    Sys->>Sys: Start live location sharing
    N->>App: See SOS on map with user location
    N->>U: Respond / Call / Navigate to help
```

- **One-tap SOS** button accessible from any screen
- Sends live location + alert to neighbors within configurable radius
- Auto-calls user's emergency contacts (family, police)
- Admin can configure SOS radius, auto-call numbers, and response protocol

