### 🆕 Feature 8: Offline Mode (SQLite Sync)

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    A["App Opens"] --> B{"Internet Available?"}
    B -->|Yes| C["Fetch from PostgreSQL API"]
    C --> D["Update Local SQLite Cache"]
    D --> E["Display Data"]
    
    B -->|No| F["Read from SQLite Cache"]
    F --> G["Display Cached Data"]
    G --> H["Queue Actions Offline"]
    H --> I{"Internet Restored?"}
    I -->|Yes| J["Sync Queue to Server"]
    J --> C
```

- Feed posts, shop listings, chat messages cached in SQLite
- Actions queued offline: posts, messages, ratings → auto-sync when online
- Conflict resolution: server timestamp wins
- Admin can set cache TTL (time-to-live)

