### Payment Flows

| Scenario | Payment Flow |
|---|---|
| **Delivery Order (Online)** | User pays via Razorpay/UPI → Platform deducts commission → Agent receives payout to wallet |
| **Delivery Order (COD)** | Agent collects cash → Marks as received → Platform deducts commission from agent's next payout |
| **Premium Shop Listing** | Shop owner pays monthly via Razorpay auto-debit or UPI |
| **Lead Fee** | Deducted from service provider's wallet when lead is accepted |
| **Featured Property** | Owner pays one-time fee via any method |
| **Wallet Top-up** | User adds money via Razorpay (UPI/Card/Netbanking) |
| **Agent Withdrawal** | Agent requests withdrawal → Admin approves → Transfer to bank via Razorpay X |

