## 20. Risk Assessment

| Risk | Impact | Mitigation |
|---|---|---|
| **Cold Start (no users)** | Critical | Physical on-ground Dhanori onboarding: 50 shops + 100 users before launch |
| **Google Maps API costs** | High | Start with status-based tracking; use Mapbox/OSM fallback; cache routes |
| **Multi-platform bugs** | High | Shared test suite; CI/CD for all 3 platforms; feature flags |
| **Payment RBI compliance** | High | Use Razorpay (pre-compliant); auto-KYC for wallets > ₹10K |
| **Data privacy** | High | Twilio proxy for contacts; location obfuscation; right to erasure |
| **Agent reliability** | Medium | Rating system; minimum delivery requirement; instant payouts |
| **Competition** | Medium | Our moat: 6 pillars combined; no competitor has all |
| **Scaling** | Medium | Docker containers; horizontal scaling; upgrade path to AWS |
| **Regional language accuracy** | Medium | Google STT + community-reported corrections |

